      "end_ms": 320,
      "intensity": { "shape": "ease_in", "from": 0.1, "to": 0.7 },
      "intent": "The caster pulls the air in: a ring of disturbed air closes on them, a small swirl spins at the palm and a few leaves are tugged toward it."
    },
    {
