      "start_ms": 470,
      "end_ms": 1100,
      "intensity": { "shape": "flicker", "from": 0.75, "to": 1.0, "flicker_hz": 5 },
      "intent": "The wind slams into the target: dust rolls out in a wave, leaves and grit are blown up and back, the ground is swept into streaks."
